{
  "name": "Monster Slayer",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can choose three creature types, except humanoids. Whenever you use Monster's Bane, you can expend up to two dice instead of just one, adding both to the roll. Both dice are expended as normal. If the target of your attack has one of your chosen creature types, you deal maximum damage with all combat superiority dice you expended, instead of rolling them.</p>",
